Scope
-----
This license covers the original work added in this repository on top of the
reconstructed sandbox base. That work is inventoried in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
under "Original work": the LLM layer (app/llm), authentication and path safety
(app/auth.py, app/pathsafety.py), the tool registry and the tools written for
it, the agent loop (app/agent), the chat UI (app/static/ui), the test suite,
the CI workflow, and the documentation written for this project.

Where a file mixes reconstructed and original code (for example app/server.py
or openapi.yaml), this license covers only the original additions, not the
reconstructed portions.

It does NOT cover:

  * the sandbox sources reconstructed from Manus's proprietary runtime
    (app/server.py and the legacy code it exposes, app/types/, app/models.py,
    app/helpers/, app/terminal_socket_server.py, the terminal / browser /
    text-editor implementations, start_server.py, data_api.py);
  * the vendored browser_use/ package, which is MIT-licensed browser-use,
    Copyright (c) 2024 Gregor Zunic — its notice is reproduced in full in
    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md;
  * third-party Python dependencies listed in requirements.txt.

